# Docker ignore for relational-sdk build context
#
# RULE: only files that exist in the GitHub repo AND are required by the
# Dockerfile COPY instructions may enter the build context.  Everything else
# is excluded here so that builds are reproducible from a clean checkout.
#
# Dockerfile COPYs exactly:
#   rust-toolchain.toml  Cargo.toml  Cargo.lock  src/  .cargo/
#   docker/relational-sdk.manifest.template
#   docker/restart_aesm.sh  docker/start.sh
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Version-control internals ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.github/
.gitignore

# ── Build artefacts ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
target/

# ── SGX artefacts (regenerated deterministically inside the container) ────────
*.sig
*.manifest
*.manifest.sgx

# ── Secrets / credentials (belt-and-suspenders; should never reach context) ──
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*
secrets/

# ── Local-only / .gitignore'd directories ─────────────────────────────────────
SPRINT/

# Local test data directory
data/

# Attestation test client (C binary + build artefacts, not needed in image)
attestation-client/

# ── Files present in GitHub but NOT used by the Dockerfile ───────────────────
# Keeping these out ensures docker build --no-cache produces identical output
# regardless of local edits.

# Deployment / infra scripts (enclave.service, deploy-staging.sh)
scripts/

# On-chain IDL reference only — drt_contract.json is not include_str!'d
idl/

# Host-side build orchestration (docker build is run by docker/build.sh, not make)
Makefile

# Build-helper script (not needed inside the running container)
docker/build.sh

# SPDX text is not required at runtime
LICENSE

# ── Documentation (markdown) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.md
!README.md

# ── Local measurements snapshot ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# measurements.toml is the pinned release contract. It is consulted by
# `make verify-mrenclave` and CI from the host, not COPY'd into the image.
measurements.toml

# Root-level dev manifest template (production uses docker/relational-sdk.manifest.template)
relational-sdk.manifest.template
